        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Tingkao thu Ravguangc dailiangmei",
            "Tingkumv khumv ma zai lou lana",
            "Kamei rui zauzianc lou khourui",
            "Taanlou puithai guay tei hou the.",
            "",
            "Typat loutho,typat loutho,",
            "Naimei kathui typat loutho",
            "Poubaomei jisu thuanc kariu khang Amen (guang e)",
            "",
            "2. Khrista guang puanc pui tyngmik khou",
            "Neila bamv mei aniw alao",
            "Asei nang changmunh gaymei khou",
            "Nang khounei khang aniu guang e.",
            "",
            "3. Poubaomei zanc khou nang tymei",
            "Pai kaneina khuan sini na",
            "Alau guay neihlaa puizaeng rui",
            "Tingkao thu suanc ladat pung e",
            "",
            "4. Poubaomei khris’ta puanc puinungc",
            "Nang khou swaihyam lou khang ty o",
            "Nang rui typat mei puat guayna",
            "Tingsaeng zaeng manc dat pulak khe."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
